<title>ZIMBABWE: TENNIS-ZIMBABWE LEAD FINLAND 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ZIMBABWE LEAD FINLAND 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe lead Finland 2-0 in</p>
<p>their Davis Cup Euro/African zone group one play-off tie after</p>
<p>winning both singles matches on Friday.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Wayne Black beat Kim Tiilikainen 6-4 7-5 6-7 (3-7) 6-3</p>
<p>Byron Black beat Vilie Liukko 6-3 6-3 6-4</p>
</text>
